pIds": ["g16"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1705916948, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 386046158, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e44", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 377, "width": 29.8, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g16"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1501079115, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1674671377, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "01", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "01", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e45", "type": "text", "x": 144, "y": 372, "width": 300.7, "height": 42.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g16"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 524193278, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 175782304, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Frame the problem", "fontSize": 34, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Frame the problem", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e46", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 432, "width": 1466.8, "height": 45.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1233565528, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 644780075, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Don't start drawing boxes. Spend 3-4 minutes here - the answers decide whether you're building an L4 packet router or an L7 reverse proxy, and that choice reshapes everything\ndownstream.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Don't start drawing boxes. Spend 3-4 minutes here - the answers decide whether you're building an L4 packet router or an L7 reverse proxy, and that choice reshapes everything\ndownstream.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e47", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 505.0, "width": 1120, "height": 196.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g17"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1127850897, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1063254276, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e48", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 519.0, "width": 141.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g17"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1879343460, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 737608423, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Questions to ask", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Questions to ask", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e49", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 547.5, "width": 1066.4, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g17"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1566471825, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 963864094, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "- Which layer? Routing TCP/UDP connections (L4) or terminating and inspecting HTTP/gRPC (L7)? Often it's both, stacked.\n- What's the traffic shape? Short request/response HTTP, long-lived WebSockets, gRPC streams, or raw TCP (a database proxy)?\n- Is session affinity required? Stateful in-memory sessions need sticky routing; a stateless backend doesn't.\n- Where does TLS end? At the edge (LB sees plaintext, can route on path/header) or passthrough (LB never sees the cert, backend terminates)?\n- Homogeneous or heterogeneous backends? Same-size instances make round robin fine; mixed capacity needs weighting.\n- Single region or global? A global answer pulls in DNS/anycast GSLB, which is a different sub-problem from picking a backend within a region.\n- What happens when every backend is unhealthy? This is the question that reveals whether a candidate has run one in production.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "- Which layer? Routing TCP/UDP connections (L4) or terminating and inspecting HTTP/gRPC (L7)? Often it's both, stacked.\n- What's the traffic shape? Short request/response HTTP, long-lived WebSockets, gRPC streams, or raw TCP (a database proxy)?\n- Is session affinity required? Stateful in-memory sessions need sticky routing; a stateless backend doesn't.\n- Where does TLS end? At the edge (LB sees plaintext, can route on path/header) or passthrough (LB never sees the cert, backend terminates)?\n- Homogeneous or heterogeneous backends? Same-size instances make round robin fine; mixed capacity needs weighting.\n- Single region or global? A global answer pulls in DNS/anycast GSLB, which is a different sub-problem from picking a backend within a region.\n- What happens when every backend is unhealthy? This is the question that reveals whether a candidate has run one in production.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e50", "type": "text", "x": 1220, "y": 503.0, "width": 414.1, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 618341637, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1307729535, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The requirements you write on the board", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The requirements you write on the board", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e51", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 541.0, "width": 1120, "height": 33.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g18"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2104909469, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 157197672, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e52", "type": "text", "x": 1229, "y": 549.0, "width": 69.2, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g18"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 253544329, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1099367391, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Functional", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Functional", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e53", "type": "text", "x": 1789, "y": 549.0, "width": 95.9, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g18"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 897911925, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 354253419, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Non-functional", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Non-functional", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e54", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 574.5, "width": 1120, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g18"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1625947776, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 734559256, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e55", "type": "text", "x": 1229, "y": 583.5, "width": 539.7, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g18"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 326384299, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2004182514, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Distribute requests across a pool of healthy backends by a configurable policy", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Distribute requests across a pool of healthy backends by a configurable policy", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e56", "type": "text", "x": 1789, "y": 583.5, "width": 401.4, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g18"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1050040258, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 905590325, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Added latency: p99 < 1 ms at L4, low single-digit ms at L7", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Added latency: p99 < 1 ms at L4, low single-digit ms at L7", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e57", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 611.2, "width": 1120, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g18"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 84196940, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2065920251, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e58", "type": "text", "x": 1229, "y": 620.2, "width": 420.1, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g18"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1434982633, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 166688708, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Detect and route around unhealthy backends within seconds", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Detect and route around unhealthy backends within seconds", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e59", "type": "text", "x": 1789, "y": 620.2, "width": 335.0, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "stroke