oundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g23"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1326270331, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1406529762, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Raw throughput and memory are not the constraint - a single modern box clears 50k L7 RPS without breaking a sweat. The real engineering is in HOW FAST AND HOW CORRECTLY THE POOL VIEW CHANGES: health-check cadence trades detection speed against probe load and flapping, and the\nhashing scheme decides whether adding one backend reshuffles the whole world. That's where sections 06 and 07 live.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Raw throughput and memory are not the constraint - a single modern box clears 50k L7 RPS without breaking a sweat. The real engineering is in HOW FAST AND HOW CORRECTLY THE POOL VIEW CHANGES: health-check cadence trades detection speed against probe load and flapping, and the\nhashing scheme decides whether adding one backend reshuffles the whole world. That's where sections 06 and 07 live.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e260", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 1721.8, "width": 2400, "height": 1940.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 32, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1016818332, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1329509788, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e116", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1761.8, "width": 64, "height": 40, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "rou