nNonce": 876538506, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SENIOR FLEX: NAME MAGLEV", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "SENIOR FLEX: NAME MAGLEV", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e890", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 16398.8, "width": 1063.3, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g161"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 217728571, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1709061707, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Google's Maglev builds a large (typically 65537-slot, prime for even distribution) lookup table once per pool change, where every backend gets a\nnear-equal number of preferred slots via round-robin-with-permutation over its own hashed sequence - connection lookup at request time is then\none O(1) array index, no walk, no binary search. It trades a bigger, slower rebuild for the fastest possible per-request pick and the most even\ndistribution. Bring it up as the answer to \"how would you make this handle millions of requests per second with zero picking overhead.\"", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Google's Maglev builds a large (typically 65537-slot, prime for even distribution) lookup table once per pool change, where every backend gets a\nnear-equal number of preferred slots via round-robin-with-permutation over its own hashed sequence - connection lookup at request time is then\none O(1) array index, no walk, no binary search. It trades a bigger, slower rebuild for the fastest possible per-request pick and the most even\ndistribution. Bring it up as the answer to \"how would you make this handle millions of requests per second with zero picking overhead.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e891", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 17016.5, "width": 236.0, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 848893221, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1425985912, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Where else churn bites", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Where else churn bites", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e892", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 17056.5, "width": 733, "height": 116.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g162"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1181411524, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 331898241, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e893", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 17070.5, "width": 118.5, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g162"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1372632778, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1146750181, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cache locality", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cache locality", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e894", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 17099.0, "width": 678.1, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g162"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 195748720, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1402432133, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "If backends hold a warm in-memory cache, consistent hashing keeps a given key hitting the\nsame backend across deploys - a modulo scheme resets your entire cache hit rate on every\nscaling event.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "If backends hold a warm in-memory cache, consistent hashing keeps a given key hitting the\nsame backend across deploys - a modulo scheme resets your entire cache hit rate on every\nscaling event.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e895", "type": "rectangle", "x": 833, "y": 17056.5, "width": 733, "height": 116.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g163"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 351520132, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 854209151, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e896", "type": "text", "x": 847, "y": 17070.5, "width": 129.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g163"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1493372775, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 582326423, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Rolling deploys", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Rolling deploys", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e897", "type": "text", "x": 847, "y": 17099.0, "width": 695.7, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g163"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 880014994, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2122226537, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A rolling deploy removes and re-adds every backend one at a time. Consistent hashing means\neach step remaps only that one backend's ~1/n share, not the whole pool - the difference\nbetween a blip and a stampede.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "A rolling deploy removes and re-adds every backend one at a time. Consistent hashing means\neach step remaps only that one backend's ~1/n share, not the whole pool - the difference\nbetween a blip and a stampede.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e898", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1606, "y": 17056.5, "width": 733, "height": 116.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g164"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 608384677, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1434113080, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e899", "type": "text", "x": 1620, "y": 17070.5, "width": 181.7, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g164"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 660556865, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 897316121, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Weighted rebuild cost", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Weighted rebuild cost", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e900", "type": "text", "x": 1620, "y": 17099.0, "width": 689.7, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g164"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2046957456, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 110296235, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Changing one backend's weight in a ring means re-placing its virtual nodes - cheap and local.\nIn Maglev it means rebuilding the whole lookup table - batch weight changes rather than\napplying them one at a time under load.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Changing one backend's weight in a ring means re-placing its virtual nodes - cheap and local.\nIn Maglev it means rebuilding the whole lookup table - batch weight changes rather than\napplying them one at a time under load.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1018", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 17333.0, "width": 2400, "height": 2487.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 32, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 340950508, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 695438973, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e902", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 17373.0, "width": 64, "height": 40, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g165"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1216592568, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1897720300, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e903", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 17380.0, "width": 29.8, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g165"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 767041904, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 889230088, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "08", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "08", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e904", "type": "text", "x": 144, "y": 17375.0, "width": 226.1, "height": 42.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g165"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 894309658, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 39112498, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Failure modes", "fontSize": 34, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Failure modes", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e905", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 17435.0, "width": 962.5, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1855954948, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1646395435, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The most common way a load balancer causes an outage is by amplifying one. Design for that before anything else.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The most common way a load balancer causes an outage is by amplifying one. Design for that before anything else.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e906", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 17485.5, "width": 2280, "height": 33.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g166"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2140225908, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1722754385, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e907", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 17493.5, "width": 46.5, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g166"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 781214548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1384006417, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Failure", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Failure", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e908", "type": "text", "x": 509, "y": 17493.5, "width": 63.5, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness"