r-backend share, spill overflow to next ring point) or fall back to load-aware picking above a threshold", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Bounded-load consistent hashing (cap per-backend share, spill overflow to next ring point) or fall back to load-aware picking above a threshold", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e938", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 17795.0, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g166"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2094970334, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1960220132, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e939", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 17804.0, "width": 125.1, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g166"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1036668715, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 675439392, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "LB tier itself down", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "LB tier itself down", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e940", "type": "text", "x": 509, "y": 17804.0, "width": 87.0, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g166"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 114620966, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1304907074, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 17920