ction speed are the bottleneck, not raw throughput.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Back-of-envelope. Land on \"membership churn and detection speed are the bottleneck, not raw throughput.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1171", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23510.0, "width": 727.3, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1498123708, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 13704616, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"A single box clears tens of thousands of RPS - the real work is how fast the pool view updates correctly.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"A single box clears tens of thousands of RPS - the real work is how fast the pool view updates correctly.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1172", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23537.8, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1841516102, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 56944331, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1173", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23546.8, "width": 33.2, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 938909932, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2052342698, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "8-14", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "8-14", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1174", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23546.8, "width": 548.6, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1556116752, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 502142847, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Draw the HLD: L4 tier, L7 tier, service discovery, control plane, async telemetry.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Draw the HLD: L4 tier, L7 tier, service discovery, control plane, async telemetry.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1175", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23546.8, "width": 656.6, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1224796846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1900004853, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"Data plane stays a single hop of decision-making. Membership is pushed, never polled inline.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"Data plane stays a single hop of decision-making. Membership is pushed, never polled inline.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1176", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23574.5, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 660889874, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1694799245, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1177", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23583.5, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 455193747, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 840875257, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "14-20", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "14-20", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1178", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23583.5, "width": 959.8, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1337070712, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1256991547, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Compare algorithms in a table. Name round robin's blind spot. Pick weighted least connections, mention power-of-two as the scale answer.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Compare algorithms in a table. Name round robin's blind spot. Pick weighted least connections, mention power-of-two as the scale answer.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1179", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23583.5, "width": 746.5, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 167079266, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1213767577, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"Weighted least connections, because it self-corrects on real load without needing a separate health signal.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"Weighted least connections, because it self-corrects on real load without needing a separate health signal.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1180", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23611.2, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1955906049, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 368392359, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1181", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23620.2, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 310515231, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 70681453, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "20-30", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "20-30", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1182", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23620.2, "width": 618.4, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 57772786, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240288481, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "LLD: the Strategy interface, Backend/Pool, the routing pipeline. Then code one algorithm.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "LLD: the Strategy interface, Backend/Pool, the routing pipeline. Then code one algorithm.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1183", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23620.2, "width": 763.6, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 229090080, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1335668601, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"One interface, several implementations, chosen per route at runtime - same shape you'd use for rate limiting.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"One interface, several implementations, chosen per route at runtime - same shape you'd use for rate limiting.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1184", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23648.0, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1994902447, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 347487015, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1185", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23657.0, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 740589107, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2098967864, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "30-36", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "30-36", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1186", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23657.0, "width": 550.5, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 304602495, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504827298, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Health checking: active + passive, the state machine with hysteresis, slow start.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Health checking: active + passive, the state machine with hysteresis, slow start.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1187", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23657.0, "width": 630.2, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 61702854, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 66292534, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"A single failed probe shouldn't eject a backend - that's how you get flapping, not reliability.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"A single failed probe shouldn't eject a backend - that's how you get flapping, not reliability.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1188", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23684.8, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 89441499, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 297216439, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1189", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23693.8, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1487401324, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1382001780, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "36-42", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "36-42", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1190", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23693.8, "width": 547.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1361242925, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 91582286, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Failure + scale: circuit breaker, fail-closed default, consistent hashing for churn.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Failure + scale: circuit breaker, fail-closed default, consistent hashing for churn.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1191", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23693.8, "width": 598.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1496812693, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 145658856, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"With zero healthy backends there's nothing safe to fail open to - I fail closed and fast.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"With zero healthy backends there's nothing safe to fail open to - I fail closed and fast.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1192", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23721.5, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1582234317, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 100264020, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1193", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23730.5, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 141229835, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1839315396, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "42-45", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "42-45", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1194", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23730.5, "width": 406.5, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1268030681, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1635885707, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Trade-offs you knowingly made, and what you'd build next.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Trade-offs you knowingly made, and what you'd build next.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1195", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23730.5, "width": 765.4, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 780408694, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 428019679, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"I picked ring-based consistent hashing for locality. At Maglev's scale I'd trade a bigger rebuild for O(1) lookup.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"I picked ring-based consistent hashing for locality. At Maglev's scale I'd trade a bigger rebuild for O(1) lookup.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1196", "type": "line", "x": 210, "y": 23430.8, "width": 0, "height": 327.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1755700219, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2049922959, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [0, 327.5]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "e1197", "type": "line", "x": 1210, "y": 23430.8, "width": 0, "height": 327.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g218"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1759998859, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1146528954, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [0, 327.5]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "e1198", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23798.2, "width": 1120, "height": 199.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g219"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1914009687, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1426280170, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1199", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 23812.2, "width": 328.1, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g219"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 141623141, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1889172733, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Five sentences that carry the round", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Five sentences that carry the round", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1200", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 23843.2, "width": 1077.6, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g219"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1863569704, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1623009217, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1.  \"A load balancer is a routing decision made under uncertainty - every algorithm here is a bet about how stale the load signal is allowed to be.\"\n2.  \"Round robin is blind to both capacity and current load; I'd default to weighted least connections and reach for power-of-two choices once pick\ncost itself matters.\"\n3.  \"Naive modulo hashing remaps almost every key when the pool changes size - that's why affinity needs consistent hashing, not raw hashing.\"\n4.  \"Health checking needs hysteresis - consecutive failures to eject, consecutive successes plus a slow-start ramp to re-admit - or the pool flaps.\"\n5.  \"With zero healthy backends there's nothing safe to fail open to, so I fail closed with a fast 503, unlike a rate limiter where failing open is usually\nright.\"", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1.  \"A load balancer is a routing decision made under uncertainty - every algorithm here is a bet about how stale the load signal is allowed to be.\"\n2.  \"Round robin is blind to both capacity and current load; I'd default to weighted least connections and reach for power-of-two choices once pick\ncost itself matters.\"\n3.  \"Naive modulo hashing remaps almost every key when the pool changes size - that's why affinity needs consistent hashing, not raw hashing.\"\n4.  \"Health checking needs hysteresis - consecutive failures to eject, consecutive successes plus a slow-start ramp to re-admit - or the pool flaps.\"\n5.  \"With zero healthy backends there's nothing safe to fail open to, so I fail closed with a fast 503, unlike a rate limiter where failing open is usually\nright.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1201", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 23798.2, "width": 1120, "height": 131.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g220"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1963677896, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1527390141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1202", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 23812.2, "width": 411.3, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g220"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2027924215, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 824295858, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "IF THEY SAY \"NOW MAKE IT HANDLE 10X THE BACKENDS\"", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "IF THEY SAY \"NOW MAKE IT HANDLE 10X THE BACKENDS\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1203", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 23835.8, "width": 1089.6, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g220"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 230029626, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 529520929, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Go in this order: switch the pick from an O(n) scan to power-of-two choices or a heap (removes per-pick scan cost), move consistent hashing from a\nplain ring to Maglev if lookup latency itself is measurable (removes the binary-search walk), and batch health-check fan-out so probe volume grows\nsublinearly (shard which LB node probes which backends, rather than every node probing every backend). Quantify each - \"power-of-two drops\nper-pick cost from O(n) to O(1), which is the one that actually shows up in profiles at that scale.\"", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Go in this order: switch the pick from an O(n) scan to power-of-two choices or a heap (removes per-pick scan cost), move consistent hashing from a\nplain ring to Maglev if lookup latency itself is measurable (removes the binary-search walk), and batch health-check fan-out so probe volume grows\nsublinearly (shard which LB node probes which backends, rather than every node probing every backend). Quantify each - \"power-of-two drops\nper-pick cost from O(n) to O(1), which is the one that actually shows up in profiles at that scale.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1205", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 24107.2, "width": 1008.4, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 240453157, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 72715147, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011532160, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Load Balancer Interview Kit - JavaScript - L4/L7. All code here is illustrative and written to be explained aloud, not pasted into production.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Load Balancer Interview Kit - JavaScript - L4/L7. All code here is illustrative and written to be explained aloud, not pasted into production.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}